{"job":{"id":20009407,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"ReSource Point of Sale LLC","title":"Troubleshoot issues with backline kds screen (may need to be remounted)  - Qdoba 3443","description":{"html":"<p><strong>You are authorized by RPOS Dispatch to handle additional repairs while onsite. We have no issues compensating technicians for helping out with our customers. Follow the Tasks to successfully complete the work order. Technician will be requested to perform cable repairs on CAT5e cabling, cabling clean-ups, or smart hands onsite to work with the Helpdesk.</strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>﻿**If you are to counter for a FIXED RATE, you agree to no additional hourly rate increases, regardless of time onsite**</em></strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>**TECH TO SUBMIT COUNTER OFFER FOR TRAVEL, IF NEEDED,&nbsp;<u>PRIOR&nbsp;</u>TO ASSIGNMENT**</em></strong></p>\n<p><strong><u>SCHEDULING:</u></strong></p>\n<p>Please attempt to contact the manager to make them aware of your ETA. Please see below for certain site requirements.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><em>Military Base Location:</em></strong> Technician will need 2 forms of ID, including a Real ID or Military ID. Tech also must schedule an escort.</li>\n<li><strong><em>Airport Location:</em></strong> Technician will need a form of ID and must schedule an escort.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><u>Scope of Work: Follow the Tasks to successfully complete the Work Order</u></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Check in and out with a member of the Qdoba IT Team at</strong> <strong><em>844-736-2224</em>, <em>Option 3</em></strong>. <strong>If there's no answer, email rposdispatch@resourcepos.com or message on your work order letting us know you cannot reach them. RPOS Dispatch will escalate the ticket, as a result.</strong></p>\n<p>The back line screen at Qdoba #3443 is not hanging properly. Could you please send a technician to resolve this issue?</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p>I have attached a picture and a video for your reference.</p>\n<p>