{"job":{"id":"2102119657","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"ASD","title":"AUTOZONE 00411- TROUBLESHOOT CAMERAS and REMOVE NON WORKING PVMs (if there's any)","description":"<p><strong>READ CAREFULLY:</strong></p><p><br></p><ul><li><em>The store need not to be notified prior to your arrival</em></li><li><em>When applying for this job you must include the proposed service date/time which you will be on site performing work. Include specific day and no more than a 2 hour time range of arrival.</em></li><li><em>We have a 5 day SLA on each tickets. Do not schedule a week after the original schedule date.</em></li><li><em>In case you are to send a different tech to site, you are REQUIRED to let us know in advance and that tech needs to have a separate onforce ticket.</em></li><li><em>Introduce yourself as an ISSKY technician.</em></li><li><em>Failure to check in/out means you did not go to site.</em></li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>SCOPE OF WORK: </strong></p><p><strong>(</strong>I NEED THIS JOB DONE BETWEEN 8AM AND 3PM ONLY.)</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>CAMERAS 8/9 ARE DOWN, ( ONE IS EXTERIOR, NOT SURE ABOUT THE OTHER, ALSO PVM IN BACK DOWN</strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Technician please check in with your Vendor PM who will reach out to ISS-KY before starting work.</p><p>Please send before and after pictures of all work.</p><p>Remove old non-working monitor. Completely remove monitor and any unnecessary mounting hardware.</p><p>Remove/secure any excess cabling.</p><p>Install new monitor, power supply, and possibly front door or attached cam if it is on the WO.</p><p>It may be necessary to create a new RG-59 BNC patch cable to connect the new PVM directly to the green output of the existing or new camera.</p><p>Have a VGA monitor to connect to DVR to view and confirm cameras views as need.</p><p>Troubleshoot any additional PVMs on-site and remove dead monitors, power supplies, mounting hardware and secure cabling.</p><p>Please hide all views before leaving site and send a confirmation picture. Check out with your Vendor PM before leaving.</p><p><br></p><p>IMPORTANT PLEASE READ!!!!!</p><ul><li>You <u>MUST</u> have a handheld/ portable monitor with you to be able to see the camera view - THIS IS A REQUIREMENT OF THE CLIENT.</li><li>REFRAIN FROM FILMING OR RECORDING WHILE ON SITE OR DOING SERVICE CALLS AND UPLOADING THEM IN ALL SOCIAL MEDIA PLATFORMS.</li></ul><p><br></p><ul><li>Please call ASD Support Contact at 828-212-4285 once you're onsite so I can conference you with our customer support for further info about the scope. You will work with Dwayne and Autozone Support while you're onsite and they will also be the ones to check us out and approve the work done.</li><li>Check and correct DVR settings</li><li>Make sure to rename the cameras accordingly.</li><li>Do not leave any new equipment at stores or risk not receiving payment</li><li>Refrain from telling the SM about more service that the store needs. Report any other outstanding issue/s directly to ASD, not to the SM or store staff.<em>(For example, all cameras need to be rewired - or - you need x and y cameras to be added - or a and b cameras are going bad. Instead, let us know on your notes.)</em></li><li>A 30 days work guarantee applies to this work order.</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Upon assignment of the work order, you must provide the exact date and time as to when you are planning to do the job within the timeframe provided.</p><p><br></p><p>Ensure all camera positions are adjusted per AZ spec. All replacement and added cameras must be installed in the ceiling tile. The photo is just a sample, do not be misled. Be prepared to run cable just in case the existing cable is bad. Check and correct network settings if it doesn't match what we have on your checklist.</p><p><br></p><p>PLEASE READ work order and REVIEW ALL attachments. PRINT the Logging into IP screen document as most of these stores have poor cellular signal. You need to be able to work independently.</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-24T08:00","end":"2026-09-24T12:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":185.18518519},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":58},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $185.18518519 is below minimum threshold $300"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-09-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02478029-851 - Free People-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 162218 - MCD-11779 - MAX (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-23T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 164043 - BK-6563 - ROUTER REBOOT - NO EQUIPMENT (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974921-University Glen-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974915-The Edition on Rosemary-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-22T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Fast Food Restaurant #4945 — Refranchise Conversion — Oxford, NC"},{"start