{"job":{"id":20012095,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Insight Enterprises Inc.","title":"Insight | Hilton | New Hardware Placement | Service Tech | Schedule date/time is FIRM","description":{"html":"<p>Insight has been engaged by Hilton Hotels to perform New Hardware Placements at their locations nation wide. The qualified resource will have the skill set and ability to perform the work, follow instructions and report to Insight. Hilton is expecting we are onsite until the job is complete</p><p>We are seeking a senior service technician/Network Smart Hands level tech. There is no network configuration but you must rack and stack devices. The expected duration is 4-8 hours depending on the device count.</p><p><strong><u>Scope (see also attached document as applicable):</u></strong></p><p>- Rack and Stack (connect cables and power) configured network devices:&nbsp;Server, Switch and UPS</p><p>- Unbox new workstations and accessories</p><p>- IF cable has been run to front desk and offices set up each computer in the required desk/office location.</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- Proper cable management for a neat look at all stations</p><p>- IF cable has not been run then connect all think clients directly to the switch in the network room</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- Hotel manager will move computers to required location at a later date</p><p>- Run Systems check on each computer to verify no DOA</p><p>- Verify Remote Technical support can connect to each thin client</p><p>- Once onsite contact Technical Support to get instructions and direction.&nbsp;There are no field instructions at this time, direction and instruction comes from technical support.</p><p><strong><u>Dress:</u></strong>&nbsp;Business Casual. No sneakers, jeans, t-shirts, etc.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Penalties/Deductions</strong>:</p><p>10% Deduction for 15 minutes or more late.</p><p>10% Deduction for being unprepared.</p><p>Tech swaps MUST be approved in advance. Failure to do so will result in no pay of WO.</p><p>Unauthorized assistants are prohibited from all Insight work. Those assistants will be asked to leave and wait offsite for you to complete the job.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Terms for Travel:</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Payment amount listed on this WO is an all-in rate</p><p>If provider is seeking additional compensation for travel time due to distance from work order, this must be requested as a counter-offer PRIOR to assignment</p><p>If submitted post-assignment, pay increase requests for travel time will not be approved</p><p>Tolls or Parking fees will only be eligible for reimbursement if receipt is attached to the work order when closed out</p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Terms for Additional Time Required Onsite</strong>:</p><p>Technician must call buyer contact listed in WO immediately upon realizing additional time over max hours in WO will be required</p><p>If additional time required is due to factors agreed to by buyer as outside of tech control; technician may submit request for pay increase for time onsite over max in WO&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;IMPORTANT: Pay increase for additional time must be requested and Approved by buyer while tech is onsite; additional time logged by tech on WO or pay increase requests will only be paid if tech obtained pre-approval from buyer POC while onsite</p><p>Tech must enter name of buyer contact who approved increase to ensure any approval questions are directed accordingly</p><p><br></p><p><em>The job is considered incomplete if you leave site before sending any required deliverables and calling Insight Command Center to check out, which will cause a delay in pay or no compensation.&nbsp;</em></p>","markdown":"Insight has been engaged by Hilton Hotels to perform New Hardware Placements at their locations nation wide. The qualified resource will have the skill set and ability to perform the work, follow instructions and report to Insight. Hilton is expecting we are onsite until the job is complete\n\nWe are seeking a senior service technician/Network Smart Hands level tech. There is no network configuration but you must rack and stack devices. The expected duration is 4-8 hours depending on the device count.\n\n**Scope (see also attached document as applicable):**\n\n\\- Rack and Stack (connect cables and power) configured network devices: Server, Switch and UPS\n\n\\- Unbox new workstations and accessories\n\n\\- IF cable has been run to front desk and offices set up each computer in the required desk/office location.\n\n\\- Proper cable management for a neat look at all stations\n\n\\- IF cable has not been run then connect all think clients directly to the switch in the network room\n\n\\- Hotel manager will move computers to required location at a later date\n\n\\- Run Systems check on each computer to verify no DOA\n\n\\- Verify Remote Technical support can connect to each thin client\n\n\\- Once onsite contact Technical Support to get instructions and direction. There are no field instructions at this time, direction and instruction comes from technical support.\n\n**Dress:** Business Casual. No sneakers, jeans, t-shirts, etc.\n\n**Penalties/Deductions**:\n\n10% Deduction for 15 minutes or more late.\n\n10% Deduction for being unprepared.\n\nTech swaps MUST be approved in advance. Failure to do so will result in no pay of WO.\n\nUnauthorized assistants are prohibited from all Insight work. Those assistants will be asked to leave and wait offsite for you to complete the job.\n\n**Terms for Travel:**\n\nPayment amount listed on this WO is an all-in rate\n\nIf provider is seeking additional compensation for travel time due to distance from work order, this must be requested as a counter-offer PRIOR to assignment\n\nIf submitted post-assignment, pay increase requests for travel time will not be approved\n\nTolls or Parking fees will only be eligible for reimbursement if receipt is attached to the work order when closed out\n\n**Terms for Additional Time Required Onsite**:\n\nTechnician must call buyer contact listed in WO immediately upon realizing additional time over max hours in WO will be required\n\nIf additional time required is due to factors agreed to by buyer as outside of tech control; technician may submit request for pay increase for time onsite over max in WO\n\n IMPORTANT: Pay increase for additional time must be requested and Approved by buyer while tech is onsite; additional time logged by tech on WO or pay increase requests will only be paid if tech obtained pre-approval from buyer POC while onsite\n\nTech must enter name of buyer contact who approved increase to ensure any approval questions are directed accordingly\n\n*The job is considered incomplete if you leave site before sending any required deliverables and calling Insight Command Center to check out, which will cause a delay in pay or no compensation.*","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-25T09:00","end":"2026-09-25T13:00"},"payRange":{"min":180,"max":450},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":4,"amount":180},"additional":{"units":6,"amount":45}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":7},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":{"shouldCounterOffer":true,"payType":"blended","counterRate":60,"baseAmount":600,"estHours":4,"travelExpense":0,"payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":4,"amount":240},"additional":{"units":6,"amount":60}},"counterDate":{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","durationMinutes":0}},"reason":"COUNTER_DATES"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-29T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.0