{"job":{"id":20012370,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"WireStar Networks","title":"Need a tech to swap out a pocket switch, provide us with the info on the back, then ship the old one back.","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Overview:</strong></p><ul><li>Seeking a technician with experience in low voltage and networking space to provide on-site assistance with network equipment.</li><li>Estimated duration will be 1 hour</li></ul><p><strong>Dress Code:</strong></p><ul><li>Pants without rips&nbsp;</li></ul><p><strong>Tools Required:</strong><em>&nbsp;</em></p><ul><li>Laptop</li><li>Ethernet Cable</li><li>crimpers</li><li>scissors</li><li>rj45s</li><li>cable tester</li></ul><p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p><p><strong><em>On-Site Tasks&nbsp;</em></strong></p><p><strong><em>call 979-721-9045 at anytime dont call 979-721-9000</em></strong></p><ul><li>Check-in to work order</li><li>pick up package from leasing for unit 1-301</li><li>go to unit 1-301</li><li>swap out pocket switch</li><li>send 979-721-9000 a picture of the back of the pocket switch</li><li>if needed verify ethernet connections work</li><li>Provide photos of areas worked</li><li>Check-out of work order after confirmed good to go from 979-721-9045</li></ul><p><strong><em>Required On-Site Deliverables&nbsp;</em></strong></p><ul><li>Confirm work is complete with NOC <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>** *************</del></span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Communication Directory:&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>NOC <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><del>** *************</del></span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Additional Hours &amp; Expenses Approval Payment Policy</strong></p><ul><li>Additional hours or expenses need to be pre-approved by the project manager before incurring on the work order.</li><li><br></li></ul>","markdown":"**Overview:**\n\n- Seeking a technician with experience in low voltage and networking space to provide on-site assistance with network equipment.\n- Estimated duration will be 1 hour\n\n**Dress Code:**\n\n- Pants without rips\n\n**Tools Required:**\n\n- Laptop\n- Ethernet Cable\n- crimpers\n- scissors\n- rj45s\n- cable tester\n\n**Scope of Work:**\n\n***On-Site Tasks***\n\n***call 979-721-9045 at anytime dont call 979-721-9000***\n\n- Check-in to work order\n- pick up package from leasing for unit 1-301\n- go to unit 1-301\n- swap out pocket switch\n- send 979-721-9000 a picture of the back of the pocket switch\n- if needed verify ethernet connections work\n- Provide photos of areas worked\n- Check-out of work order after confirmed good to go from 979-721-9045\n\n***Required On-Site Deliverables***\n\n- Confirm work is complete with NOC \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**Communication Directory:**\n\n- NOC \\*\\* \\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\\*\n\n**Additional Hours & Expenses Approval Payment Policy**\n\n- Additional hours or expenses need to be pre-approved by the project manager before incurring on the work order.\n-","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-24T13:00","end":"2026-09-24T14:00","latestStart":"2026-09-24T15:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":75},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":9},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $75 (countered: $75) is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-28T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-29T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00