{"job":{"id":20012837,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"ImageQuest Managed Services","title":"NC-HIGHPOINT-58545: Site Down, Troubleshoot and Get Back Online [INC-2638485]","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Tech will need:</strong></p><ul><li>Laptop with ethernet port and CAT5 cable</li><li>A fully charged mobile phone</li><li>Box of Cat5 cable with RJ45s/48s, if needed, to replace any bad cables/plugs (or a variety of new CAT5 cables of various lengths)</li><li>Cable tester, toner w/ probe, crimper</li></ul><p><strong>TECH SOW:</strong></p><p><strong>NOTE:</strong> Site is a Tier 1 with multiple IT network rooms.&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Tech will need to verify all UPSs are up and operational.</li><li>Tech will need to Work with Amairany (Adapt IT): (689) 216-4317 to troubleshoot connection.. If no answer, Text 407.779.0700 to initiate communication.</li></ul><p><strong><em>NOTE: WAN 1 is currently down, and a ticket has already been opened with Comcast's fiber team to investigate that issue. However, WAN2 is showing online and not sure why the site has no internet connectivity. </em></strong></p><ul><li>If Adapt IT cannot resolve, may need to work with MSP: Viking Cloud (877-556-8279) to confirm device is online and configured correctly. Reference ticket#: 9768115</li><li>Tech will need to provide any additional IT assistance they may need.</li></ul>","markdown":"**Tech will need:**\n\n- Laptop with ethernet port and CAT5 cable\n- A fully charged mobile phone\n- Box of Cat5 cable with RJ45s/48s, if needed, to replace any bad cables/plugs (or a variety of new CAT5 cables of various lengths)\n- Cable tester, toner w/ probe, crimper\n\n**TECH SOW:**\n\n**NOTE:** Site is a Tier 1 with multiple IT network rooms.\n\n- Tech will need to verify all UPSs are up and operational.\n- Tech will need to Work with Amairany (Adapt IT): (689) 216-4317 to troubleshoot connection.. If no answer, Text 407.779.0700 to initiate communication.\n\n***NOTE: WAN 1 is currently down, and a ticket has already been opened with Comcast's fiber team to investigate that issue. However, WAN2 is showing online and not sure why the site has no internet connectivity.***\n\n- If Adapt IT cannot resolve, may need to work with MSP: Viking Cloud (877-556-8279) to confirm device is online and configured correctly. Reference ticket#: 9768115\n- Tech will need to provide any additional IT assistance they may need.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":true,"time":{"start":"2026-09-23T12:00","end":"2026-09-23T20:00","latestStart":"2026-09-23T17:00"},"payRange":{"min":88,"max":704},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":88,"estLaborHours":8,"distance":69},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 9/23/2026, 12:00:00 PM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T17:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-23T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 162218 - MCD-11779 - MAX (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-23T17:00:00.000Z","end":