{"job":{"id":20013369,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Quikk-IT Services LLC","title":"Printer Swap","description":{"html":"<p><strong>Service Description:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Seeking a technician: Sr. Networking/Infra Tech</li>\n<li>Tech is required to replace the printer and then onboarding it in the stores printer management tool</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Estimated duration will be up to 2 hour(s)<em>.</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Time onsite is delayed, and hours may exceed 2 hours to contact Kiara immediately</strong> <del>************</del></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Dress Code:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Business casual is required. <em>e.g., collared shirt, pants, and appropriate shoe wear.</em></li>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\">No stains, rips, or logo branding.</li>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\">No shorts or athletic wear.</li>\n<li class=\"ql-indent-1\">No open toe or \"running\" shoes (plain sneakers are okay).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Tools Required:</strong> <em>must haves</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>﻿</em>Laptop with console capabilities</li>\n<li>Cellular device with hotspot</li>\n<li>Basic networking tools</li>\n<li>Basic telephony tools</li>\n<li>Basic hand tools</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></p>\n<p><strong><del>*** *** ******* ***** ****** ** ****** ****** **** ******** **** ***** ********</del></strong></p>\n<p><strong><del>*********** ******** ** ******** ** **** **** ***** ********** ******* ** ****** ** ******</del></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Techs are responsible for replacing the printer, and then onboarding it in the stores printer management tool.</li>\n<li>I have attached instructions on how to replace the printers in the tool.</li>\n<li>If for some reason a printer is in a room we can't access, tech should note it on check out and install the printer with a patch cable somewhere in the MDF.</li>\n<li>The printer management tool has an \"add printer\" button as well. We can ask the store to do the physical swap. After the swap is done, we ask