{"job":{"id":20013866,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Liquid Networx","title":"Network & Phone replacement/cutover & test / verify - Goldsboro, NC","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>TRAVEL REIMBURSEMENT MUST BE DONE WHEN APPLYING FOR THE WORK ORDER.</u> <u>REQUESTS AFTER BEING ASSIGNED THE WORK ORDER WILL BE SUBJECT TO BEING DENIED.</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>On-Site Instructions:</u></strong></p><ul><li>Text <del>******* * ************</del><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</span> when arriving onsite and when checking out.</li><li>Call technical contact for questions - do not provide pricing or mention Field Nation</li><li>Worker will need laptop with Putty installed, console cable, and hot spot in case remote troubleshooting is needed.</li></ul><p>LCON: Julie Cameron</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Worker will need to:</u></strong></p><p><strong>Join Teams Bridge (client provided) and work with BrightSpring Network team</strong></p><p><strong>Rack: 1 x FW, 1 x SW, &amp; install 1 x AP</strong></p><p><strong>Install new : Ring Central / Yealink phones</strong></p><p><strong>Work with Network team to: remove existing devices and install new Fortinet. Hang AP, Install &amp; bring up RC/Yealink phones, smart hands for device config and cutover. Assist site with test / verification.</strong></p><p><strong>Label cabling and use best practices for cable management for a clean / professional appearance.</strong></p><p><strong>Provide patch cabling - if needed - for network rack</strong></p><ul><li>Cleanup workstation</li><li>Take photo of all work completed</li><li>Upload Sign Off Sheet</li><li>Send text message to <del>******* * ************</del> when leaving the site with photos of work completed.</li><li>Upload all deliverables and mark work order complete within 48 hrs.</li><li>Failure to complete the above tasks will result in non-payment</li></ul><p><strong><u>Requirements</u></strong><u>:</u></p><ul><li>Send text message to <del>*