{"job":{"id":20013769,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Insight Enterprises Inc.","title":"Insight | JPMC MaCD | See Scope In Service Description","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Opportunities for Badged techs on projects, MACD and B/F work</u></strong></p><ul><li><strong>We are seeking Badged techs to qualify for ongoing work at branch locations for a bank, one of Insight's largest clients. This badge is a mandatory requirement for techs to be eligible for this work.</strong></li><li><strong>By becoming a badged tech for this end-customer you'll gain access to a consistent stream of work routed by Insight. If you're not yet badged, you can start the process today through this program page: </strong><u>https://fieldnation.com/work/insight</u></li><li><strong>Newly badged techs are eligible for a one-time bonus upon receiving your badge. Details are available through the recruitment link.</strong></li></ul><p>Insight has been engaged by <del>**** </del>to assist with their Ad Hoc needs. Please make sure to read all standard instructions before accepting OR requesting this workorder.</p><p>Please see tracking before going to site or call <del>******* *************</del> Tracking is added to the ticket the morning of the job if applicable. Look in the shipments section.</p><p>**<strong>CHECK YOUR EMAIL THE MORNING OF REGARDING YOUR ASSIGNED WO **</strong></p><p><strong><u>SCOPE:</u></strong></p><p>!! BEFORE you mark yourself ONSITE It is essential that you call the Insight team - 1-800-215-8968. <br/>Do not leave the site UNTIL you call the Insight team.  Contact Insight for instruction!!!<br/><br/>***Check in and out with Chase Tier 2! We need the name of the person who releases you!  800-475-4089 opt 3 ***<br/><br/>Client Reference number:  255856408<br/><br/>Onsite Date:  Sep 24<br/><br/>End User: Priscilla Saul W532356<br/> <br/>Scope:  Install replacement platform monitor</p><p><strong><em><u>Please do not take any photos of Chase computer screens.</u></em></strong></p><p>&nbsp;<strong><u>UNLESS:</u></strong></p><ul><li>&nbsp;it is photo the blue Bitlocker screen after the TPM is broken.</li><li>&nbsp;Photo of log in screen for VDI/Teller installs, monitor installs and monitor arm installs.</li><li>&nbsp;If photos of cable management are needed, please ensure computer screen is not in photo if powered on.</li><li>&nbsp;Other photos such as error messages, are only allowed to be taken if requested by Chase support or Insight support.</li><li>Any photos taken while on Chase premises, should be immediately deleted from phone once site is complete.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>PLEASE NOTE: Even if tracking shows part on site, do not show up earlier or later than the date assigned without prior approval. The branch has been made aware of the original date and Insight needs to confirm any changes with the client in advance if a request is being made.</u></strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><del>*</del><strong><u><del>*** ****</del> Work Order &amp; Support Procedures</u></strong></p><p>A Smartphone is required for all technicians. Unless directed by the <del>***** </del>help-desk at no time should a technician be taking pictures, video, or any recording while inside a <del>***** </del>branch. No laptops or tablets should ever be brought into a banking location. Nothing about the work performed, activities inside the branch, or reference to <del>***** </del>should ever be posted on any social media site.Business casual dress required, no tennis shoes or jeans. You will be turned away if you show up with unprofessional attire.</p><p>No smoking on location.</p><p>Please follow the below procedures, includes information on who to call to initiate support and what information must be documented in the ticket. All required information must be documented for a completed ticket.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>For escalation.</strong></p><p><strong><del>********** **** **** ****** ******* ******* **** ** ******** ** *****