{"job":{"id":20010418,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"KIOSK Information Systems","title":"ARK | Sheetz 634 Offline Troubleshoot","description":{"html":"<p>This work order is to get our customer back up and running.</p><p>Only accept the work order if you can be there in the time allotted.</p><p><strong>Must call the Work Order Manager to Check in and Check out - not doing so may be subject to pay penalty</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>The technician is responsible for returning defective parts. Do not leave any parts on site, WO will not be paid until defective parts are mailed back</strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Standard Tools Required:</strong></p><ul><li>Standard Tool Set</li><li>Nut Drivers or Socket Set</li><li>Electronic Safe Wipes or Cloth</li><li>A to B USB Cable</li><li>Compressed air/Canned Air</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Scope of work:</strong></p><p><strong>Check in with Work Order Manager</strong></p><p>Troubleshoot<strong>:</strong></p><ul><li>Check power at wall and trace to inside kiosk to PC</li><li>Verify power to PC and peripherals from the internal JBOX</li><li>Verify power indicator lights on power supplies inside kiosk</li><li>Reseat power connections</li><li>Perform reset of PC (Hold power button on PC for 30 seconds)</li><li>Troubleshoot issue or determine next step w/KIS</li><li>Call KIS to confirm PC reporting online</li><li>Test with customer</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Call the Work Order Manger for Checkout</p><p>Company: Kiosk Information Systems Inc.</p><p>346 S Arthur Ave.</p><p>Louisville, CO 80027</p><p>(303) 926-3154</p>","markdown":"This work order is to get our customer back up and running.\n\nOnly accept the work order if you can be there in the time allotted.\n\n**Must call the Work Order Manager to Check in and Check out - not doing so may be subject to pay penalty**\n\n**The technician is responsible for returning defective parts. Do not leave any parts on site, WO will not be paid until defective parts are mailed back**\n\n**Standard Tools Required:**\n\n- Standard Tool Set\n- Nut Drivers or Socket Set\n- Electronic Safe Wipes or Cloth\n- A to B USB Cable\n- Compressed air/Canned Air\n\n**Scope of work:**\n\n**Check in with Work Order Manager**\n\nTroubleshoot**:**\n\n- Check power at wall and trace to inside kiosk to PC\n- Verify power to PC and peripherals from the internal JBOX\n- Verify power indicator lights on power supplies inside kiosk\n- Reseat power connections\n- Perform reset of PC (Hold power button on PC for 30 seconds)\n- Troubleshoot issue or determine next step w/KIS\n- Call KIS to confirm PC reporting online\n- Test with customer\n\nCall the Work Order Manger for Checkout\n\nCompany: Kiosk Information Systems Inc.\n\n346 S Arthur Ave.\n\nLouisville, CO 80027\n\n(303) 926-3154","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-23T17:00","end":"2026-09-23T18:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":75},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":1,"distance":0},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $75 is below minimum threshold $180"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-23T15:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","summary":"Gap"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","summary":"Miniso"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","summary":"Ortodont Dana"},{"start":"2026-09-25T19:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-25T22:00:00.000Z","summary":"Granite"},{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.