{"job":{"id":20016288,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Nova Remote IT LLC","title":"Network Installation","description":{"html":"<p>Install FortiGate 40F.</p><p>Prior attempt failed due to missing config in FortiManager; verify config is resolved before turn-up.</p><p>Connect and test once config issue is confirmed fixed.</p><p><br></p><p><ul><li><strong>You are scheduled 30 min ahead of the scheduled conference bridge</strong></li><li><strong>Use this 30 min to locate and mount any hardware, any other prep work, get laptop online and ready to go once the bridge opens</strong></li><li><strong>Any travel must be preapproved through a counteroffer.</strong></li></ul></p><p><strong>Required Tools: Laptop with Anydesk, Teams App, Standard Telecom Toolset, Label maker, Console cables, Velcro/zip ties, spare/extra copper patch cables, step ladder.</strong></p><p><strong>Devices should be mounted in rack or on wall and clearly labeled.</strong></p><p>Please review confidential section for site specific details</p><p><ol><li>Arrive on site and contact LCON. Bridge will open at top of the hour - <strong>join the Teams bridge ontime regardless.</strong></li><li>Work with turn up engineer on bridge for direction and instructions.</li><li>Engineer will release you when completed. Capture close code.</li><li>Clean up work area and close out.</li></ol></p>","markdown":"Install FortiGate 40F.\n\nPrior attempt failed due to missing config in FortiManager; verify config is resolved before turn-up.\n\nConnect and test once config issue is confirmed fixed.\n\n- **You are scheduled 30 min ahead of the scheduled conference bridge**\n- **Use this 30 min to locate and mount any hardware, any other prep work, get laptop online and ready to go once the bridge opens**\n- **Any travel must be preapproved through a counteroffer.**\n\n**Required Tools: Laptop with Anydesk, Teams App, Standard Telecom Toolset, Label maker, Console cables, Velcro/zip ties, spare/extra copper patch cables, step ladder.**\n\n**Devices should be mounted in rack or on wall and clearly labeled.**\n\nPlease review confidential section for site specific details\n\n1. Arrive on site and contact LCON. Bridge will open at top of the hour - **join the Teams bridge ontime regardless.**\n2. Work with turn up engineer on bridge for direction and instructions.\n3. Engineer will release you when completed. Capture close code.\n4. Clean up work area and close out.","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-10-01T08:30","end":"2026-10-01T10:30"},"payRange":{"min":120,"max":170},"payType":"blended","payStructure":{"type":"blended","base":{"units":2,"amount":120},"additional":{"units":1,"amount":50}},"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":13},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","rejectDetails":"Total pay $170 is below minimum threshold $450"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-10-01T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-02T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-05T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-06T00:00:00.000Z"}],"busyBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T14:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 USK8 NC-Jacksonville Mall Miniso Retro (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-25T12:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-26T00:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 Budderfly - 162218 - MCD-11779 - MAX (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 02207602 + Swarovksi - Swarovski #63 + epik cutover / revisit (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-05T14:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-05T17:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974921-University Glen-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-10-15T17:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-10-15T20:00:00.000Z","summary":"🔧 05974915-The Edition on Rosemary-EPIK Survey (WM)"},{"start":"2026-09-22T19:30:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-22T23:30:00.000Z","summary":"Fast Food Restaurant #4945 — Refranchise C