{"job":{"id":"8920320780","platform":"WorkMarket","company":"CSA Solutions","title":"Higi - Repair","description":"<p>URGENT - Worker must go onsite today.</p><p><br></p><p>Unit was tampered with and displayed inappropriate videos.</p><p>Tech needs to Call Jerry at higi (Higi Technical Support: 866-818-8793 Opt 1 Opt 3 Desk: 626-269-3974) and will walk the tech through what is needed. Tech will harvest the PC and send to Higi with provided return label.</p><p><br></p><p>Use this password to access the kiosk: iENNEXJFM</p><p>If swapping out a PC, you would use:&nbsp;miker0me0g0lfech0&nbsp;</p><p>If you have questions or require technical support during the service,&nbsp;call 931-284-4999 and follow the prompts to reach the&nbsp;EMSAR&nbsp;Level II Support team for assistance (Support Hours are Monday-Friday from 8:00 AM EST until 8:00 PM EST). Provide the team member with the Work Order number,&nbsp;location,&nbsp;and problem description. At the completion of the service contact the&nbsp;EMSAR&nbsp;Level II Support team so that they can remotely verify that the kiosk is online and operational.&nbsp;</p><p>**ALL NON-EMSAR&nbsp;TECHNICIANS: You must check in from the location as soon as you arrive onsite and before you begin working on the kiosk. Call 931-284-4999 and follow the prompts. If there are any questions about the service expectations, use this opportunity to ask the Level II Support&nbsp;team.**&nbsp;</p>","isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-23T02:00","end":"2026-09-23T06:00"},"payRange":{"min":0,"max":195.45454545},"payType":"fixed","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":0,"estLaborHours":4,"distance":57.2},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"WO_IN_PAST","rejectDetails":"Requested start 9/23/2026, 2:00:00 AM is in the past"},"availableBlocks":[{"start":"2026-09-23T13:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-23T15:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-23T16:00:00.000Z","end":"2026-09-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"start":"2026-09-24T23:00:00.000Z","end":"2026