{"job":{"id":20018170,"platform":"FieldNation","company":"Global Data Systems","title":"(#1247179) AP Replacement","description":{"html":"<p><strong><u>Scope of Work:</u></strong></p><p>*This order i to replace an AP that was determined faulty. Once installed verify connectivity with customer. Call REV support if needed at anytime. Clean up work area when complete. Rev reference number TT 948841</p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(15, 45, 82); --darkreader-inline-color: var(--darkreader-text-0f2d52, #ffffff);\" data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\"><u>Required&nbsp;Deliverables&nbsp;to be paid</u></strong></p><ol><li>Signed Field Service Report</li><li>Photos</li></ol><p><strong>Personal Attire:</strong></p><p>Dress, grooming, and personal cleanliness standards affect your business image to customers. You should dress and groom yourself according to the requirements of your position and accepted social standards. This is particularly true if your job involves dealing with customers in person.</p><p>The following items are considered acceptable dress attire for a site visit:</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Wear your ID that represents the company you work for</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Sleeved collared shirts</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Close toed shoes</p><p>The following items are <u>not</u> considered professional dress attire for a site visit:</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Dirty, Ragged, Holes, or otherwise non-professional appearing attire</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Shorts</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;T-shirts</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Flip-flops</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Jeans</p><p>·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Hats</p><p><strong>Equipment needed for your site visit:</strong></p><p>o&nbsp;&nbsp;WiFi enabled laptop</p><p>o&nbsp;&nbsp;Ethernet Cable for connectivity to the network</p><p>o&nbsp;&nbsp;USB to Serial adapter</p><p>o&nbsp;&nbsp;Console Cable</p><p>o&nbsp;&nbsp;Mobile Hotspot</p><p>o&nbsp;&nbsp;Cable tester/ Cable Toner</p><p>o&nbsp;&nbsp;Smart Phone</p><p>o&nbsp;&nbsp;Allen Wrenches (Metric and Standard)</p><p>o&nbsp;&nbsp;Digital Volt Meter</p><p>o&nbsp;&nbsp;Assortment of Phillips and Flat Screwdrivers</p>","markdown":"**Scope of Work:**\n\n\\*This order i to replace an AP that was determined faulty. Once installed verify connectivity with customer. Call REV support if needed at anytime. Clean up work area when complete. Rev reference number TT 948841\n\n**Required Deliverables to be paid**\n\n1. Signed Field Service Report\n2. Photos\n\n**Personal Attire:**\n\nDress, grooming, and personal cleanliness standards affect your business image to customers. You should dress and groom yourself according to the requirements of your position and accepted social standards. This is particularly true if your job involves dealing with customers in person.\n\nThe following items are considered acceptable dress attire for a site visit:\n\n· Wear your ID that represents the company you work for\n\n· Sleeved collared shirts\n\n· Close toed shoes\n\nThe following items are not considered professional dress attire for a site visit:\n\n· Dirty, Ragged, Holes, or otherwise non-professional appearing attire\n\n· Shorts\n\n· T-shirts\n\n· Flip-flops\n\n· Jeans\n\n· Hats\n\n**Equipment needed for your site visit:**\n\no WiFi enabled laptop\n\no Ethernet Cable for connectivity to the network\n\no USB to Serial adapter\n\no Console Cable\n\no Mobile Hotspot\n\no Cable tester/ Cable Toner\n\no Smart Phone\n\no Allen Wrenches (Metric and Standard)\n\no Digital Volt Meter\n\no Assortment of Phillips and Flat Screwdrivers","actions":[]},"isRequestedWindow":false,"time":{"start":"2026-09-24T14:00","end":"2026-09-24T16:00"},"payRange":{"min":75,"max":150},"payType":"hourly","payStructure":null,"hourlyRate":75,"estLaborHours":2,"distance":16},"result":{"eligible":false,"counterOffer":null,"reason":"PAYMENT_BELOW_MINIMUM","r